cff-version: 1.2.0
message: Cite this software if you use the Trail parser or its audit trail format.
title: LogParser-Trail
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-05"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/TMFNK/LogParser-Trail
authors:
  - name: MbitAI
    website: https://www.mbitai.com
abstract: >
  Trail: a deterministic-first log template miner with a per-decision
  audit trail. v0.1 ships the deterministic core, the audit JSONL format,
  and a 60-line labeled sample. Its optional local-model assist proposes
  audit-cited template merges and splits without changing parser outputs.
keywords:
  - log-parsing
  - template-mining
  - audit-trail
  - offline
  - reproducibility
  - small-language-models
references:
  - type: article
    title: "A Large-scale Evaluation for Log Parsing Techniques: How Far are We?"
    authors:
      - family-names: Jiang
        given-names: Zhihan
    year: 2024
    url: https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.10828
